                                                "sense_id": "5804c3ef-b836-3227-8e25-972603d3c300",
                                                "text": "Engineers are considering using the blowable insulation to rehabilitate residential buildings in Chicago under an Argonne partnership with Bethel New Life, a Chicago community economic initiative."
