                                                "text": "Patty Wahlers, 40, is the founder and director of Horse of Connecticut, an organization situated on a 46-acre farm in Washington that rescues and rehabilitates neglected horses and puts them up for adoption."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
