                                                "sense_id": "e7582968-7c2d-382f-bbf7-3c67392895f8",
                                                "text": "Truman made us all feel welcome and relaxed as we shook hands with him. We sat around the desk, and he spoke very earnestly about the necessity of rehabilitating Europe and emphasized his concern that peaceful German production should be encouraged."
